  "model": "MAXIMIZE 5*x_truck + 10*x_airplane + 8*x_boat + 7*x_train\nSUBJECT TO\n  wood: 12*x_truck + 20*x_airplane + 15*x_boat + 10*x_train <= 890\n  steel: 6*x_truck + 3*x_airplane + 5*x_boat + 4*x_train <= 500\n  truck_train_exclude: x_truck <= 100*y  (y binary)\n  truck_train_exclude2: x_train <= 100*(1-y)\n  boat_airplane: x_boat <= x_airplane\n  boat_train: x_boat <= x_train\nVARIABLES\n  x_truck, x_airplane, x_boat, x_train integer >= 0\n  y binary"
